          "arabic": "فِي عَائِلَتِي سِتَّةُ أَفْرَاد: أَبِي وَأُمِّي وَثَلَاثَةُ إِخْوَة وَأَنَا.",
          "transliteration": "fee 3aa2ilatee sittatu afraad: abee wa ummee wa thalaathatu ikhwa wa anaa.",
          "english": "There are six people in my family: my father, my mother, three brothers and me."
